stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Connected: WebSocket opens
  Connected --> Preparing: receive subscription payload
  Preparing --> Rejected: parse, operation, or schema validation fails
  Preparing --> Active: rewrite subscription as query
  Active --> Refreshing: invalidation signal observed
  Refreshing --> Active: query result sent
  Active --> Active: ping, pong, or duplicate signal
  Active --> Closed: unsubscribe or socket closes
  Rejected --> Closed
  Closed --> [*]
